globs: src/app/api/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# API

- `POST /api/agents/run` is SSE (`text/event-stream`). One JSON object per `data:` line.
- Validate `message`. Fall back to `DEFAULT_CONTEXT` if the brief is missing.
- `GET /api/health` reports `demo` vs `llm` so the UI can show mode without leaking keys.
- Keep route handlers thin. Crew logic stays in `src/lib/agents`.
- `runtime = "nodejs"` for the crew. Do not switch this to edge without checking LLM fetch + session memory.
